<title>INDIA: India's Chidambaram begins presenting 97/98 budget.</title>
<headline>India's Chidambaram begins presenting 97/98 budget.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Finance Minister P. Chidambaram on Friday began presenting the government's 1997/98 (April-March) budget to parliament.</p>
</text>
